<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - ITEQ started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - ITEQ started as buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said Thursday it had started coverage of ITEQ Inc with a rating of buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Houston maker of air pollution control systems opened up 1/4 at 7-1/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
